 },
 "body": [
  {
   "t": "sub_sub_header",
   "id": "e2acd00f-8790-468d-b0bd-96c36de93ac4",
   "r": [
    [
     "App 图标"
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal_background"
  },
  {
   "t": "image",
   "id": "b734c9e1-18b4-49f5-9c0b-f93e32fbd534",
   "r": [
    [
     "Untitled"
    ]
   ],
   "file": "app-icons-brand-color/01.jpg",
   "w": 1600,
   "h": 900
  },
  {
   "t": "quote",
   "id": "82dbfb68-4abe-4b57-9d1a-d5f164a38992",
   "r": [
    [
     "Prefer including text only when it’s an essential part of your experience or brand.",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal"
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "2b8d32b4-efef-4d2b-b31f-47883a97a495",
   "r": [
    [
     "只有当文字是你的产品体验或品牌的重要组成部分时，才可以让图标内含文字。",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ],
    [
     "这里提出这个建议的主要原因是"
    ],
    [
     "文字形式图标不利于本地化。",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ],
    [
     "如果要用的话，也是在产品概念已经深入人心的阶段，比如淘宝app就会用“淘”字作为 app 图标，因为淘宝这个产品早已被国内很多用户在使用，但如果在品牌尚未打造出影响力的时候，用产品首文字作为传播主体，并不容易让人记住。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quote",
   "id": "d5c282e2-3acf-4f13-8795-056d4b9884ca",
   "r": [
    [
     "Prefer graphical images to photos and avoid replicating UI components in your icon.",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal"
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "6034dfee-cc3a-40c2-9eba-054b6dcbdbf8",
   "r": [
    [
     "无独有偶地，第二点建议就是："
    ],
    [
     "尽量使用图形而不是照片，并且避免在你的图标中复制 UI 组件。",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ],
    [
     "这里主要考量是，照片或者UI界面，都会增加图标的复杂度，不好理解或让人记住。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quote",
   "id": "b86aad8d-2bd3-4e91-833a-354b7e8b58c5",
   "r": [
    [
     "Don’t use replicas of Apple hardware products.",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal"
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "883c24f1-f01d-4f1c-8cf4-a027143b3edf",
   "r": [
    [
     "不要使用苹果硬件产品当图标。苹果产品是有版权的🐶"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "callout",
   "id": "71b8da6a-a9e1-45e8-a5d3-85451ca98ee6",
   "r": [
    [
     "相关资源："
    ],
    [
     "https://developer.apple.com/design/resources/",
     [
      [
       "a",
       "https://developer.apple.com/design/resources/"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal_background",
   "icon": "💡"
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "7f1962b4-7ace-4245-abff-8868b76ef9e5"
  },
  {
   "t": "column_list",
   "id": "afbdac58-385f-4ed7-baaf-f48addc17b02",
   "c": [
    {
     "t": "column",
     "id": "def464b3-3fa3-4dd6-9657-80028c2ef4b4",
